The dish looks like a small white bowl about 15 cm across. It holds a few orange pieces that look like roasted sweet potato or pumpkin, or possibly wrapped candy. There is a white sauce or residue at the bottom, which could be yogurt or cream.

I estimate about 5 pieces at roughly 15 g each, so around 80 g. Adding some sauce brings the total to about 100 g. Roasted squash or sweet potato runs about 1.2 kcal/g, which gives about 120 kcal. The sauce and any oil add roughly 30 kcal, for a total near 150 kcal.

